{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Backgrounds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world once belonged to us, at least that\u2019s what we believed. Until that day, everything changed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those meteorite craters were like gates to hell, from which swarmed the \u3010Alien Bugs\u3011 that destroyed everything, leaving only ruins behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then there was the \u3010Bug Virus\u3011 spreading through the air\u2014once infected, no matter how strong one\u2019s willpower, they would turn into mindless \u3010Zombie Thugs\u3011.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is what I still remember after being rescued by the \u3010Survivors\u2019 Alliance\u3011. As for what I did before the disaster or where I lived, I have no memory at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that doesn\u2019t matter anymore. All I know is that I didn\u2019t become one of the walking dead\u2014instead, I was modified and trained into a \u3010Bug Slayer\u3011, specialized in exterminating alien insects and zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although those terrifying monsters still roam everywhere, the Alliance has a new project, codenamed \u3010Rebirth\u3011.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And I will contribute my last ounce of strength, returning to those occupied city ruins...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 Bug Slayer PT021 \u00b7 Log</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Bug Slayer\u3011Survivors who have been modified and trained, dispatched by the\u3010Survivor Alliance\u3011to various locations for final missions as part of the \u3010Rebirth Project\u3011.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453440/extras/ca3cfb0654efc0d9c49e33f74358a7a2.avif?t=1763129949\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Bug Rebuilder\u3011Their origins and identities remain unverified, but they are undoubtedly crucial to the\u3010Rebirth Project\u3011. Stay alert for SOS signals related to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453440/extras/0186d05dceb729b8e768cd9971ecb40f.avif?t=1763129949\" width=600 height=150 /></span> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Survival Resources\u3011Make full use of collected weapons, food, medicine, and other resources to keep alive ...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453440/extras/0d626e1042813bf30b97cb4459036276.avif?t=1763129949\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Alien Bugs\u3011Extraterrestrial &quot;bugs&quot; that drift through space via meteorites, invading and plundering survival resources from other planets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453440/extras/0d74159f9cabf257707dbdd6c9d244a2.avif?t=1763129949\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Zombie Thugs\u3011Former compatriots infected by the\u3010Bug Virus\u3011, now reduced to irrational, frenzied monsters. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453440/extras/c3acc4e78c3fa03a68e524c54af842f7.avif?t=1763129949\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Chaser\u3011Extremely dangerous entities, yet not entirely invincible.</p><p cla